    '/office-furniture/seating/recliner-lounge-chairs/' => 'Recliner and lounge chairs furnish the softer parts of a workplace, the breakout corners, waiting lounges, staff relaxation areas and executive anterooms where people pause, wait or hold informal conversations. OfficeLand supplies lounge and recliner seating in Lagos in single tub chairs, two- and three-seater sofas, modular soft seating and reclining armchairs, in fabric and leatherette finishes to suit the setting. Choose according to the space and its use: compact tub chairs and benches work in reception and corridors, while deeper sofas and recliners suit executive lounges and staff rest areas. For high-traffic public areas, prioritise hard-wearing, wipe-clean upholstery and firm, resilient foam that keeps its shape; for private executive spaces you can lean toward plusher comfort and richer finishes. Build quality shows in the frame and the foam, so look for a solid hardwood or steel frame, quality high-density foam and durable stitching, all of which stand up to Nigeria\'s climate and constant use far better than soft, low-density padding that sags within months. OfficeLand delivers and installs lounge and recliner seating nationwide and can furnish complete reception and breakout areas as part of a fit-out. To style a comfortable waiting or relaxation space, request a quote and we will respond within four working hours.',

    '/office-furniture/seating/visitor-reception-chairs/' => 'Visitor and reception chairs are the seats your guests use, so they shape first impressions while needing to withstand constant turnover in a busy waiting area. OfficeLand supplies visitor and reception chairs in Lagos in cantilever and four-leg frames, stackable models for flexible rooms, and linked beam seating for lobbies, clinics and public offices where several people wait in a row. Choose based on footfall and setting: a professional office reception suits upholstered cantilever chairs with armrests, while high-traffic government and institutional waiting areas benefit from beam seating or wipe-clean polypropylene shells that clean quickly and resist heavy use. Comfort still matters for visitors who may wait a while, so look for adequate seat padding or a well-shaped shell rather than bare, unforgiving seating. Durability is the main test here, and in Nigeria\'s climate powder-coated or chromed steel frames, stain-resistant fabric or easy-clean leatherette and strong frame joints keep chairs looking presentable through years of public use. OfficeLand delivers and installs visitor and reception seating nationwide, supplies beam seating in bulk for public institutions and can match chairs to your reception desk. To seat your waiting area smartly and durably, request a quote and our team will respond within four working hours.',

    '/office-furniture/storage-furniture/' => 'Storage furniture keeps an office organised, secure and compliant, giving documents, equipment and personal belongings a proper place instead of cluttered desks and stacked boxes. This category brings together everything OfficeLand supplies for keeping a workspace in order: filing cabinets for active records, cupboards and lockers for secure and personal storage, and bookcases and shelving for reference materials and display. Planning storage well means matching the furniture to what you keep and how often you reach for it. Frequently used files belong in accessible lateral or vertical cabinets near the team, archived records suit lockable cupboards, and shared or staff items call for lockers. Think about footprint too, since tall units free up floor space while lateral units suit low-ceilinged or divided areas. Security and build quality are central: look for sturdy powder-coated steel for heavy or sensitive storage, reliable locks for confidential records, and anti-tip features on tall units. In Nigeria\'s humid, dusty conditions, sealed steel and quality laminates protect contents and resist corrosion far better than flimsy alternatives. OfficeLand stocks office storage in Lagos across all these types and delivers nationwide with professional installation, including bulk orders for records rooms and tenders. Explore the subcategories below and request a quote; we respond within four working hours.',

    '/office-furniture/storage-furniture/bookcases-shelving/' => 'Bookcases and shelving organise the reference materials, binders, manuals and display items that accumulate in any office, library, school or government department, keeping them visible and within reach. OfficeLand supplies bookcases and office shelving in Lagos in open and glass-fronted wooden bookcases for executive offices and libraries, and in steel shelving and racking for store rooms, archives and high-load use. Choosing starts with weight and location: books and bound files are heavy, so shelves must be rated to carry the load without bowing, and adjustable shelf heights let you store items of different sizes efficiently. Measure the wall and ceiling height to make the most of vertical space, and for taller units insist on wall-fixing brackets or anti-tip fittings for safety, especially in public and school settings. Material depends on the setting, with laminate or veneer bookcases suiting client-facing offices and powder-coated steel shelving built for heavy archive and storeroom duty. In Nigeria\'s humidity, sealed finishes and rust-resistant steel keep shelving sound and protect what sits on it. OfficeLand delivers and installs bookcases and shelving nationwide and can equip entire libraries, archives and store rooms as part of a fit-out or tender. To plan storage that fits your space and load, request a quote and we will respond within four working hours.',

    '/office-furniture/storage-furniture/cupboards-lockers/' => 'Cupboards and lockers provide secure, enclosed storage for the things an office needs to keep safe or out of sight, from confidential files and supplies to staff personal belongings. OfficeLand supplies office cupboards and lockers in Lagos in steel and wooden stationery cupboards with adjustable shelves and lockable doors, and in personal lockers in various compartment counts for staff rooms, schools, factories and changing areas. Choose a cupboard by what it holds: full-height units with adjustable shelves suit bulky stationery and archived files, while half-height cupboards fit under worktops or serve as room dividers. For lockers, pick the compartment size and count to match your headcount and what staff need to store, and decide between key, padlock-hasp, combination or digital locks based on how the lockers will be managed. Security and durability are the priorities, so powder-coated steel with sturdy locks and reinforced doors resists forced entry and heavy daily use far better than light alternatives, and ventilation slots help in Nigeria\'s humid climate by reducing damp and odour inside. OfficeLand delivers and professionally installs cupboards and lockers nationwide and supplies them in bulk for schools, ministries, hospitals and industrial sites. To specify secure storage for your team, request a quote and our team responds within four working hours.',

    '/office-furniture/storage-furniture/filing-cabinets/' => 'Filing cabinets keep active and archived documents organised, secure and quick to retrieve, which still matters in Nigerian offices where paper records remain central to administration, compliance and audit. OfficeLand supplies filing cabinets in Lagos in vertical cabinets of two, three and four drawers for compact filing against a wall, and in lateral cabinets that store more files across a wider frame and suit offices with floor space to spare. Choose by how you file and how much you keep: vertical units fit tight corners and store front-to-back, while lateral units give faster side-to-side access to large volumes and double as low room dividers. Look for full-extension drawer runners so the back files are easy to reach, a central or anti-tilt lock that secures the whole cabinet, and a mechanism that stops more than one heavy drawer opening at once for safety. Build quality is decisive here, and sturdy powder-coated steel with smooth ball-bearing slides and a reliable lock withstands constant use and resists the rust that Nigeria\'s humidity brings to lesser cabinets. OfficeLand delivers and installs filing cabinets nationwide and supplies them in bulk for records rooms, registries and tenders. To organise your filing securely, request a quote and we will respond within four working hours.',
